	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t04r0201_workman2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>サザナミの　リゾートを　もっともっと
はってん　させるべく　こうじスタート！▼
そしたら　かざんと　つながって
しぜん　すごいなー　って　ところだわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T02:57:36" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T02:55:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>サザナミの　リゾートを　もっともっと
発展させるべく　工事スタート！▼
そしたら　火山と　つながって
自然　すごいなー　って　ところだわ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T02:58:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T02:57:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・swanで追加</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T02:57:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>WORKMAN2</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-04T02:55:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
